        "id": 1001591
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-21T03:18:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That sounds reasonable. Renamed to DawnRenderPassSampleCount and updated all error messages, comments, and documentation to match.\n\nAnd yes, the Vulkan extension is more flexible in that you can pick and choose targets to apply the MSRTSS to, while here we\u0027re making it an all or nothing (for color at least) thing.",
      "parentUuid": "404cf7f4_51dcd439",
      "revId": "7b012de7ec76bcb8dc83ef43db15493078fb1607",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
